    {
      "id": "claim_87c360a05dc54a46ad8e83cdc7e409af",
      "statement": "The main-process Node environment is created in ElectronBrowserMainParts::PostEarlyInitialization using Node's MultiIsolatePlatform (gin's platform depends on a Chromium task scheduler that isn't running yet), and ends with JoinAppCode(); the embed thread and polling start later in PreMainMessageLoopRun.",
