    {
      "id": "claim_fb670b71bf7a4e7eb5ddda3bb6b1fa5d",
      "statement": "PrepareEmbedThread runs only once per process, because on Windows the IOCP is fixed at loop creation, and adds a dummy uv_async handle so libuv does not exit when idle; on single-core Windows machines the IOCP concurrency limit is set to 2 to avoid a busy poll loop.",
